## What This Adds

**Memory System:**
- `.project-brain/memory/history.md` — Session index
- `.project-brain/memory/instructions.md` — Project-specific learned preferences
- `.project-brain/inbox/lessons.md` — Lesson capture
- `work-state.md` — Current focus, features, backlog

**Global Config ([global-config-dir]):**
- `about-me.md` — Your personal context (edit this!)
- `CLAUDE.md` — Agent configuration

## Skills

- `/brain:prime` — Session start (read context + history)
- `/brain:wrap` — Session end (update history + capture learnings)
- `/brain:dream` — Process lessons from inbox
- `/brain:commit-push-pr` — Commit, push, create PR

